{"type": "tool_call", "n": 15, "ts": 1790153560.584221, "tool": "flag_exception", "args": {"description": "US\u2194DE intercompany does not fully reconcile at 3/31/26. US booked JE-00306 on 2026-03-30 ('IC adj DE per call') for $1,320 debiting Intercompany Receivable (1400) / crediting Intercompany Mgmt Fee Income (4800), posted by r.hale with NO supporting documentation (no IC invoice, no email/call notes). DE has no corresponding entry and I could not locate any support to justify booking a matching EUR liability on DE's books. Per policy, I am not booking anything on DE's side for this amount since it is unsupported. Recommend controller follow up with r.hale to obtain support or reverse JE-00306 in US. Until resolved, US Intercompany Receivable ($10,450) will exceed DE Intercompany Payable (now \u20ac8,300 = $9,130 at 3/31 rate of 1.10) by this $1,320 (net of the $156 legitimate FX remeasurement already reflected in both).", "amount": 1320, "related_ids": ["JE-00306", "JE-00171", "JE-00272", "JE-00174", "JE-00309", "JE-00308"]}, "is_error": false, "result": {"exception_id": "EXC-001", "status": "logged for controller review"}, "ms": 11}
