{"type": "tool_call", "n": 17, "ts": 1790153571.7423959, "tool": "submit_memo", "args": {"text": "US\u2013DE Intercompany Reconciliation \u2014 March 2026 Close\n\nSTARTING BALANCES (3/31/26):\n- US Intercompany Receivable (1400): $10,450.00\n- DE Intercompany Payable (2300): \u20ac7,800.00 (before my entry)\n\nCOMPONENTS OF US RECEIVABLE ($10,450):\n1. JE-00171 (2/20/26): IC recharge ICI-DE-01, software licenses Feb 2026, EUR 7,800 @1.08 = $8,424.00 \u2014 supported by DOC-0125, matched by DE's JE-00174 (booked \u20ac7,800 to 6200/2300). \u2714 Reconciled.\n2. JE-00272 (3/18/26): IC recharge ICI-DE-02, CI/CD tooling seats March 2026, EUR 500 @1.10 = $550.00 \u2014 supported by DOC-0190. DE had NOT booked this side. \u2714 Now corrected (see below).\n3. JE-00308 (3/31/26): FX remeasurement of the EUR-denominated IC receivable to month-end policy rate 1.10 (DOC-0204, Treasury FX rates) = $156.00. Recomputed independently: (7,800+500) EUR \u00d7 1.10 = $9,130 vs. original USD booked of $8,974 (8,424+550) \u2192 $156 delta. Ties out exactly. \u2714 Legitimate, supported, no action needed.\n4. JE-00306 (3/30/26): \"IC adj DE per call,\" $1,320.00, debit 1400 / credit 4800, posted by r.hale \u2014 NO supporting documentation attached, no corresponding entry or evidence on DE's side, no invoice number, no email/call notes located in document store. \u2718 Unsupported.\n\nACTION TAKEN:\n- Posted JE-00309 on DE (EUR 500, Dr 6200 Software Subscriptions / Cr 2300 Intercompany Payable), supported by DOC-0190 (IC invoice ICI-DE-02), to record DE's legitimate liability for the March tooling recharge that had not yet been booked on DE's side. DE Intercompany Payable is now \u20ac8,300.00.\n- No entry was booked on DE's side for the $1,320 US adjustment (JE-00306) because no support could be located. Per close policy, unsupported items are flagged rather than force-reconciled.\n- Logged EXC-001 for controller review: JE-00306 ($1,320, posted by r.hale 3/30/26, no support) is the sole remaining reconciling item between US and DE intercompany balances. Recommend controller obtain support from r.hale or reverse the entry.\n- Marked DE \"Intercompany reconciliation\" checklist item as BLOCKED pending resolution of EXC-001.\n\nRESULT:\n- US Intercompany Receivable: $10,450.00 (unchanged)\n- DE Intercompany Payable: \u20ac8,300.00 \u00d7 1.10 = $9,130.00 equivalent\n- Reconciled/supported portion ties out exactly ($9,130 = $9,130).\n- Remaining unreconciled difference: $1,320.00, entirely attributable to unsupported US-side entry JE-00306, escalated via EXC-001 and not booked to DE absent support."}, "is_error": false, "result": {"status": "memo submitted; task complete"}, "ms": 10}
